                                     + "\n\t\u2022 Psycho total drug effect and cooldown lasts 1 minute instead of 2 minutes."
                                     + "\n\u2022 Reduced instant effect of healing drugs but increased their heal over time effect:"
                                     + "\n\t\u2022 Super Stimpak: 6/8 Initial heal and additional two times 3/8 Heal over time (T0, 2, 6 sec)"
                                     + "\n\t\t\u2022 Super Stimpaks only heal over time with this trait else they are just one big heal."
